Package: vabaxos-connections
Architecture: all
Maintainer: VabaxOS <https://github.com/Vabax-dev/VabaxOS>
Section: net
Priority: optional
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1 (>= 1.5), network-manager, bluez
Description: Wi-Fi and Bluetooth of VabaxOS, said aloud
 One window with two pages. Wi-Fi: the networks, the strongest first,
 one row per name, with protection and signal said in words; the password
 asked in a dialog; disconnect, forget, hidden networks. Bluetooth: search
 for new devices, pair and connect them (headphones, speakers, keyboards,
 Braille displays), with the code to compare or to type said digit by
 digit by its own pairing agent. Super+K opens the Bluetooth page.
